"But you saw what he did! The way he fought! That trick with the disappearing sword!"

//【ｅｔｃ／住民Ｂ】
<voice name='ｅｔｃ／住民Ｂ' class='その他男声' src='voice/md06/0200510e110'>
//「あんな真似、武者にしかできねえよ！」
"I'm telling you that's musha shit!"

pt:
//【ｅｔｃ／住民Ｂ】
<voice name='ｅｔｃ／住民Ｂ' class='その他男声' src='voice/md06/0200490e110'>
